---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const title = 'Mobile Shop Inventory Software — POS Plan';
const description =
  'Track stock automatically as you sell. POS Plan updates inventory on every sale, supports IMEI tracking for mobile shops, and works across multiple outlets.';
const canonical = 'https://erpboss.com/inventory';
---

<Base title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical}>
  <Nav slot="nav" />

  <h1>Stock tracking that updates itself</h1>
  <p>
    The most common inventory mistake in a small shop isn't a bad process — it's no process.
    Stock gets counted by memory, and gaps only show up when a customer asks for something
    that's supposedly "in stock" but isn't. POS Plan closes that gap by tying stock directly to
    every sale, automatically.
  </p>

  <h2>Built for mobile shops: IMEI &amp; serial tracking</h2>
  <p>
    Selling phones means every unit is unique. POS Plan lets you track individual items by IMEI
    or serial number, not just a generic product count — so you always know exactly which unit
    sold, and which units are still on the shelf.
  </p>

  <h2>Low-stock visibility</h2>
  <p>
    See what's running low before a customer asks for it. No spreadsheet exports, no manual
    stock-take just to find out what to reorder.
  </p>

  <h2>Multiple outlets, one account</h2>
  <p>
    Running more than one shop? Stock is tracked per outlet, with transfers between outlets
    logged the same way a sale is — so nothing disappears in a handoff between locations.
  </p>

  <p>See how billing and stock work together on the <a href="/barcode">barcode page</a>, or check <a href="/pricing">pricing</a>.</p>
  <p><a href="https://app.erpboss.com/frontend/signup">Start your free trial</a></p>

  <Footer slot="footer" />
</Base>
